<title>FINLAND: FINNISH EURO MP ELECTION, RESULTS OF ADVANCE VOTES.</title>
<headline>FINNISH EURO MP ELECTION, RESULTS OF ADVANCE VOTES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Support for the main parties in</p>
<p>Finland's European Parliament election according to unofficial</p>
<p>results on Sunday (figures  nationwide percentages of votes cast</p>
<p>in advance at post offices):</p>
<p>			Municipal	    Parliament     Municipal</p>
<p>		     election 1996	election 1995  election 1992</p>
<p> Centre Party	  26.0		   19.8	     19.2</p>
<p> SDP		     22.1		   28.3	     27.1</p>
<p> Conservatives	 20.7		   17.9	     19.1</p>
<p> Leftist Alliance    10.7		   11.2	     11.7</p>
<p> Green Party	    5.5		    6.5		6.9</p>
<p> Swedish Party	  4.7		    5.1		5.0</p>
<p> Young Finns	    3.1		    2.8		N/A</p>
<p> Christian League     3.1		    3.0		3.2</p>
<p>Full unofficial results due around 2300 local time (2000</p>
<p>GMT).</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
